;Revision 2.3  91/09/16  16:39:59  rabii
;	 Merge of V2.0 and Locus (locus check-in by roman)
;	 System calls changed types due to file descriptor handling being
;	 moved from the server to the emulator. Some system calls were
;	 made "NOSERV" for entire emulator handling. System calls with
;	 file descriptor as the first parameter were either changed
;	 to "STUB" or "FSMSG". Change other system calls dealing with
;	 file descriptors (i.e. open(), pipe(), socketpair()) to
;	 "STUB" handling. Number of arguments for certain system calls
;	 that were incorrect were adjusted (accuracy is necessary for
;	 routines that become "STUB" or "NOSERV"). Changed certain system
;	 calls to "VPMSG" for generic system calls directed at vprocs.
;
